@ContentService_HostAddress = http://localhost:7461
@timestamp = {{$timestamp}}

### ============================================
### ANALYSIS CONTENT TEST SCENARIOS - 12 Combinations
### ============================================
### Analysis workflow: Multiple customer contents + Provider combinations
### Same 12 combinations as customer content (external audio + internal audio)
### ============================================
### Note: Replace {customerContentId} with actual IDs from customer-content tests
### ============================================

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 1: Analysis with External Audio Path (Fast + Quick + FastExternal)
### outline-fast + audio-quick + video-fast-external
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/analysis-contents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: cid-001-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-001",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "title": "Analysis Test 1 - Fast Outline + Quick Audio + Fast External Video",
  "customerContentIds": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"
  ]
}

